  "residual": "Finite actual metric spaces only. The invariant-constructor contraction and geometric bound use the original W1DualLE predicate; this does not itself identify coupling W1 with that predicate. The generated four-factorization margin theorem covers the explicit continuous occupation-limit functional property subclass and requires one actual recurrent class for each of the four kernels. It makes no factorization claim for survival, time-zero or arbitrary frozen properties. General Polish transport duality, completeness and nonfinite regeneration are separate obligations."
